@startuml
!theme plain
title Eval System V2 - End-to-End Job Execution Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor       User
participant "Frontend (React)"      as FE
participant "Backend API (FastAPI)" as BE
participant "JobQueueService"       as JQ
participant "BoardManager"          as BM
database    "Postgres + Disk"       as DB
participant "Zybo Agent"            as ZA
participant "FPGA"                  as FPGA

== Upload assets ==
User -> FE : Upload VCD / Firmware
FE   -> BE : POST /files/upload
BE   -> DB : insert files row + save to disk
BE  --> FE : { file_id, checksum }

== Create and start job ==
User -> FE : Build test set, click Run
FE   -> BE : POST /jobs\n{ vcd_file_id, firmware_file_id,\n  target_board_id (optional), priority }
BE   -> JQ : enqueue(job)
JQ   -> DB : insert jobs row (PENDING)
BE  --> FE : { job_id }
FE   -> BE : POST /jobs/{id}/start

== Scheduling ==
JQ   -> BM : pick eligible board
BM   -> DB : SELECT board WHERE state=ONLINE FOR UPDATE
BM   -> DB : boards.locked_by_job_id = job_id\nboard_status.state = BUSY
JQ   -> DB : jobs.state = RUNNING

== Dispatch to hardware ==
JQ   -> ZA   : POST /execute { job_id, files }
ZA   -> BE   : GET /files/{vcd_id}, /files/{fw_id}
ZA   -> FPGA : flash firmware (openocd)
ZA   -> FPGA : drive VCD vectors
FPGA --> ZA  : capture binary stream

== Stream results back ==
ZA   -> BE : PUT /results/{job_id}/stream\n(Transfer-Encoding: chunked)
BE   -> DB : binary -> HDF5 in storage/\ninsert results row
BE   -> FE : WS event "job.progress"

== Completion ==
ZA   -> BE : POST /jobs/{id}/complete\n(pass/fail, metrics)
BE   -> JQ : finalize(job)
JQ   -> BM : release(board)
BM   -> DB : board_status.state = ONLINE\nclear locked_by_job_id
JQ   -> DB : jobs.state = COMPLETED
BE   -> FE : WS event "job.completed"
FE  --> User : toast + result link

== Watchdog (parallel) ==
BM   -> ZA : GET /status (every 10-30s)

note right of BM
  - Missed heartbeats  -> state = OFFLINE
  - Job timeout        -> cancel + reboot board
end note
@enduml
